cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MyMoMo-Academic (abm-auto): Autonomous Agent-Based Modeling Research Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An autonomous agent-based-modeling research system that turns a plain-language
  research scenario into executable simulations, parameter calibration, and
  research-quality reports — on a self-developed, dependency-free simulation
  engine. Supports reproducing published studies and originating new models
  across domains.
type: software
authors:
